#AREA Pompeii~
#AUTHORS Crouton~


#HELPS
-1 POMPEII `POMPEII`~
POMPEII
In the shadow of a sinister mountain of destruction, Pompeii stands
defenseless. Panic stricken citizens flee aimlessly in the streets,
unable to escape the inevitable doom that will befall it. The vulcano
has erupted, and lava even now begins to fill the streets.

(A) Bambino's Bar

{a}BAMBINOSBAR
~
-1 BAMBINOSBAR~
Located on the east side of town, Bambino's is a great place to get
away from the stress caused by rioting, lava, and imminent doom.
You can also order a drink and get the local gossip there. Maybe he
can tell you how to help the city.

{110}Quest added by Yosho and McMac (2001){300}
~
0 $~



