He looks mean.~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_SMART|ACT_NO_ORDER|ACT_BODY|ACT_RACE
AFF_UNDERSTAND|AFF_TONGUES
0 S
35 BODY_HAND BODY_HAND 9d50+150 4d9+9
3000 RACE_HUMAN
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>all_greet_prog 50~
if quest (0, 3, $n) == 0
  close gate
  lock gate
  say Sorry, the city is closed.
  say The volcano to the north is erupting right now.
  say Try back later when we're not in such pandemonium.
  smile $n
endif
~
>all_greet_prog 100~
if quest (0, 3, $n) == 3
  mpmload 12568
  say Ah, our blessed messenger returns!
  say Thanks to you our town shall be saved!
  say Panic is already receding.
  say Lava flows are being stemmed with barricades.
  mpmset $n quest 0 3 4  
endif
~
>speech_prog p I have lava repellent 2000.~
say Oh, in that case...
unlock gate 
open gate
say You're good to go then.
~
>speech_prog help~
if quest (0, 3, $n) == 1
  say Thank the Gods for people like you.
  mpoload 12525
  give i12525 $n
  say You'll need that.
  say Things are so chaotic that no one can seem to
  say find Souldeo. We need his leadership!
  say Find him so that plans may be made and we shall
  say all be very grateful to you!
  mpmset $n quest 0 3 2
endif
~
|
