>all_greet_prog 100~
shout BBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMM!!!!
shout BBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMM!!!!
shout BBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMM!!!!
smile 
say What's yer poison?
emote stands at his bar ready to pour you a drink.
