#12568
souldeo~
Souldeo~
Souldeo, the sherrif of Pompeii, stands here.~
A powerful looking drow elf stands here with a large star pinned to his
shirt.~
ACT_SMART|ACT_NO_ORDER|ACT_BODY|ACT_RACE
AFF_TONGUES
0 S
58 BODY_HAND BODY_HAND 3d1200+1 4d10+30
50000 RACE_DROW
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>all_greet_prog 99~
if quest (0, 3, $n) == 2
  emote listens intently to the news you bring him.
  say Excellent! I thought I alone had stayed!
  say I shall contact the gatekeeper and begin plans
  say immediately. Our fair city may yet be saved!
  recho Souldeo hurries towards the gates.
  mpmset $n quest 0 3 3
  mppurge self
endif
~
>rand_prog 80~
if quest (0, 3, $r) == 4
  say Our city will never be as fair as it once was, but with
  say time perhaps we can stem the lava completely and rebuild.
  smile $r
  mpforce pompeii emote shakes your hand.
  mpoload 12526
  give i12526 $r
  say Take this souvenir so you'll never forget us!
  mpmset $r quest 0 3 5
  emote heads back into the city.
  mpgoto 12528
endif
~
>death_prog 100~
if actorhasobjnum(30900)
or actorhasobjnum(30966)
or actorhasobjnum(30967)
or actorhasobjnum(30968)
or actorhasobjnum(30969)
  if quest(30,1,$n) == 0
    mpmset $n quest 30 1 1
    mpoload 30914
    mpforce $n HELP GUILDTOKEN
    mpquiet on
    c 'giant strength' $n
    give i30914 $n
    mpquiet off
  endif
endif~
|
